                      width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Recall that the <em>first principal component</em> of the data corresponds to the direction in which the data varies the most (the direction where we have the maximum variance).</p>\n<p>In our diagram, the direction where the variance changes the most corresponds (approximately) to the vector <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.946ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 838 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\mathbf{a},</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"559\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> as shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-3d4c15dc774d411a46923bd50d98ca35\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/3d4c15dc774d411a46923bd50d98ca35\"></div> \n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.299ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 559.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\mathbf{a}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> only.\"  </p>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
